# Onderon, a doctor's alibi (TSL, 502OND, 512OND, 503OND): the Iziz
# cantina, Panar in the beast-riders' room asked about Sullio's murder
# and Dhagon's motive (her insults that night), Nikko told of it (only
# friendly banter, Mandalore: look at the scene) and asked about the night
# and where the body lay; outside, the trash heap (dried blood) and the
# serving droid's remains behind it; Panar on the droid (1B-8D fences its
# parts), 1B-8D's parts of Bahima's droid bought (25 credits), Kiph shown
# S-0D3's head (its last feed: the shot from the marketplace), Nikko shown
# the feed: to Captain Riiken and his major (502OND), Dhagon cleared (the
# two were friends; Nikko saw him come from his office), Riiken asked to
# see the doctor, and Dhagon Ghent in his office (512OND): a Jedi Master
# in the Palace to be reached, his encrypted holodisks taken by Bakkel's
# gang (cantinarats).
# Starts from Riiken's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @onderon_alibi data/routes/tsl/onderon_alibi.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Iziz Cantina" ("Murder Most Foul")
# (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# The Rodian's visa (onderon_spaceport): Bahima's word on it sends the
# Exile to Kiph (a_kiph_trigger), who slices it open for 500 credits
# (a_visa_sliced), and Gormo is given it for nothing (LSP; he pays anyway).
# Left: the swoop races (510OND: the bike, Persuade for the fee), Nikko's
# pazaak, the other visa buyers (Sakarie, Xaart), Gelesi (Vaklu's side),
# the Twi'lek dancers.
#
# ASSUMES:
# - docalibi at Riiken's step (a_alibi_start); Mandalore and Mira in the
#   party (Mandalore's lines in d_thug, nikko, al_droid and mp_128).
# - At least 25 credits for 1B-8D (R24 is gated by c_chkcredits).
# - the cantina's bouncer (can_boun, tr_bouncer_talk) only talks:
#   no reply asked.
# - Kiph's first talk (start 1) goes through E38 (his business,
#   c_local_notset) before the hub where R20 "I have the remains of
#   S-0D3" is offered; if E38 ends the talk, `use kiph` again (start 2's
#   E0 leads to the same hub).
# - Nikko's R30 (the motive) needs a_alibi_motive (Panar's R36 or
#   Kiph's R35) first, and c_alibi_check gates R25, R21, R16 by stage;
#   answered here in DSimpson's order.
# - a_alibi_end loads 502OND at From_Alibi1 (Riiken's start 2, the major's
#   start 5, Riiken's start 6), a_alibi_end3 loads 512OND at From_Alibi2;
#   Dhagon's first talk starts by itself there (tr_alibi_end2).
exit To_512
module 512ond
exit To_503          # the cantina
module 503ond
say I'd like to talk to you about Captain Sullio's murder. # Panar
say Do you know any reason why Dhagon Ghent would kill Sullio? # (motive)
use npc_panar
talk
say Can I talk with you about Captain Sullio's murder? # Nikko
say Someone was saying that Sullio deeply humiliated Dhagon
say What happened on the night of the murder?
say Where did you find the body?
say Tell me how you know Dhagon.
say I'll be going.   # not his pazaak
use npc_nikko
talk
exit To_502          # out to the Western Square
module 512ond
use alibi_garbage    # the trash heap (al_trash: a bark, the dried blood)
use alibi_droid      # S-0D3's remains (al_droid)
talk
exit To_503
module 503ond
say I'd like to talk to you about Captain Sullio's murder. # Panar again
say I found a broken serving droid by the murder scene.
say Any idea which scavenger got to his droid?
say You know that? Where?
use npc_panar
talk
exit To_502
module 512ond
say 1B-8D, I need to know if you have any parts # the droid vendor
say I want to buy those parts.
say Here's 25 credits.
use npc_128          # by its template: its tag is the number 128
talk
exit To_503
module 503ond
say I want to talk to you about Captain Sullio's murder. # Kiph
say I have the remains of S-0D3
use kiph
talk
say I have an extra starport visa # Bahima (c_extra_visa): Kiph's the slicer
say I'll be going now.
use bahima
talk
say A friend of a friend told me # Kiph (c_extra_visakiph)
say Here's 500 credits. # a_visa_sliced: the open visa
use kiph
talk
say What do you want? # Gormo, captain of the Tweigar
say I do have an extra open visa. # (c_visa_have)
say Keep your credits. # a_visa_quest (LSP, a_lightsml)
use npc_gormo        # by his template
talk
say Can I talk with you about Captain Sullio's murder? # Nikko
say I want to show you S-0D3's last transmission. # a_alibi_end
use npc_nikko
talk
module 502ond        # Riiken and the major
say Dhagon Ghent couldn't have killed Captain Sullio.
say Nikko can explain it.
say They were friends. Sometimes friends tease each other.
say That's true. Nikko saw him come from his office.
say I want to talk with the doctor. # a_alibi_end3
say Mandalore said you might be able to help me out. # Dhagon Ghent
say It is a Jedi Master.
say Can you get in touch with someone inside the Palace?
say Who has them?    # Bakkel's gang (cantinarats)
talk                 # Riiken, his major, Riiken again: one conversation
module 512ond        # (a_alibi_end3 loads the square at From_Alibi2)
talk                 # Dhagon in his office (tr_alibi_end2, by itself)
save onderon_dhagon
